OL,3,GNEWSALeisure centre evacuated after
OL,4,Aelectrical fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sports complex in Kent has been
OL,7,Fevacuated after a fire caused by an
OL,8,Felectrical fault, emergency services
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FKent Fire and Rescue Service was called
OL,12,Fto Hartsdown Leisure Centre in
OL,13,FHartsdown Road in Margate at 18:10 GMT
OL,14,Fon Friday.
OL,16,FThree fire engines attended and crews
OL,17,Fwearing breathing apparatus used main
OL,18,Fjets to extinguish the blaze.
OL,20,FCrews left the site at 21:00 and no
OL,21,Finjuries were reported., said the fire
OL,22,Fservice.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
